# Shiko, Paragon of the Way exiles Ornithopter (mana value 0) from Bot1's graveyard, copies the card in exile and casts the copy: a
# copy of a permanent spell becomes a token as it resolves (CR 707.10f). Bot1 ends with an Ornithopter token on the battlefield and the
# Ornithopter card in exile. Two Entombs put Ornithopter and a Swamp into the graveyard beside themselves and the Black Lotus (the
# Entomb shuffles the library, which holds only Swamps by then, so the draws are known).

